  nonce: 6dda  # 6dda
  message: "Approval received — thank you. (1) HYBRID confirmed: hard-warn/abort the merge when a 'Closes|Fixes|Resolves (WI|INV|META)-…' reference is present but the item is still open; auto-close ONLY on an explicit evidence-carrying line ('Closes-with-evidence: <ID> (PR #N; repro: <cmd> -> <result>)'). (2) DECISION: shared closure-scan + closure logic in scripts/lib/forgejo-api.sh, invoked from the merge-completion paths of BOTH auto-pr AND merge-pr — both can complete a merge so guarding one leaves a hole; centralizing in the shared lib avoids duplicated regex and gives one tested seam. Auto-close always passes --note with the evidence string (preserves WI-dafun/G10). Sequencing after INV-rahib; auto-pr per your approval."  # 6dda
